{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the next chapter in the fan-favorite <i>Chronicles</i> saga by stepping into the sandals of history\u2019s greatest conqueror \u2013 Alexander the Great \u2013 and embark on a sweeping, narrative-driven campaign that traces his rise from precocious youth to world-shaking ruler. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Alexander\u2019s legendary exploits, from his bold teenage ambitions to his triumphant march across Persia, his audacious expedition to South Asia, his dramatic return journey. Crafted with the well-known <i>Chronicles</i> narrative flair and meticulous historical authenticity, this expansion delivers an immersive campaign experience brimming with drama, strategy, and replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/6ee483afceed05b264fd0774231b928e.poster.avif?t=1758231358\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF from Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition \u2013 Providence, featuring three rapid scenes. First, a lush green battlefield unfolds with rocky cliffs and a river flowing north to south. A green-trimmed army of elephant riders charges into defending forces near a stone-built village. The scene transitions to a large stone city under siege, where green-trimmed Infantry and Battering Rams have broken through the gates and push into nearby buildings. The final scene zooms in on a castle crumbling to the ground as a Battering Ram rolls onward toward its next target. The animation highlights shifting terrain, unit diversity, and the escalating momentum of ancient warfare.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/6ee483afceed05b264fd0774231b928e.webm?t=1758231358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/6ee483afceed05b264fd0774231b928e.mp4?t=1758231358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Expansive Grand Campaign:</strong> 18 richly detailed scenarios \u2013 16 as Alexander\u2019s Macedonians, plus two unique Thracian and Puru scenarios \u2013 to chronicle every pivotal moment of his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Animated Mosaic Cutscenes:</strong> Stunning, artful cinematics bring each chapter to life, blending classical aesthetics with modern animation techniques.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Three New Civilizations:</strong> Command the disciplined Macedonians, the swift-raiding Thracians, or the elephant-riding Puru, with two new architecture sets for distinctive visual flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\t<strong>Customizable Campaign Army:</strong> Unlock 16 bonus units and 4 bonus technologies, then deploy them in later scenarios to tailor your force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tVisual &amp; Audio Upgrades: Revamped siege weapon models and 13 original music tracks heighten the drama of every battle and march.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Legendary Civilizations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Macedonians</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pin your enemies with pike-wielding Phalangite infantry and break their lines with the thunderous Companion cavalry. Build Fortified Outposts to stage lightning assaults, then unleash pike and horse in perfect harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Thracians</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of raiding: with swift Rhomphaia Warriors, deadly skirmishers, and unique technologies which reward death and destruction with gold, your foes will learn to fear these hardy mountain men.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Puru</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate your opponents with mighty war elephants, supported by bamboo-longbow archers whose volleys sow chaos. Build an army that combines brute force with precise ranged support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/0a657d6e0a04c147635478ed9c0267c4.poster.avif?t=1758231358\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF from Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition \u2013 Providence, showcasing three quick civilization spotlights. First, a large purple-trimmed Macedonian city sits near a shoreline, bustling with troops and enclosed by tall stone walls. Flat grassy fields and lush green trees stretch beyond the perimeter. Golden text at the bottom reads, \u201cThe Macedonians.\u201d The second scene reveals a sprawling Thracian city built into rocky cliffs and hilly terrain, with ancient stone buildings clustered around a central outcropping crowned by a pillared structure. Golden text reads, \u201cThe Thracians.\u201d The final scene highlights a desert peninsula stronghold belonging to the Puru civilization. Orange-trimmed infantry stand in formation along the shore, while small patrols circle a tall, domed central building. The shimmering water and arid terrain emphasize the city\u2019s strategic isolation and grandeur.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/0a657d6e0a04c147635478ed9c0267c4.webm?t=1758231358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/0a657d6e0a04c147635478ed9c0267c4.mp4?t=1758231358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Man\u2019s Destiny</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike any previous expansions, Alexander the Great dedicates the full campaign to one extraordinary figure, granting space for an in-depth character study. Experience all of Alexander\u2019s most famous battles, including the Granicus, Gaugamela, and the Hydaspes, as well as Thracian and Puru scenarios which illuminate parallel stories of allies and adversaries. Cutting-edge level design brings these encounters to life with unique mechanics, objectives, and map features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge a Battle-Tested Army</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress in the campaign, unlock 16 bonus units \u2013 including Achaemenid chariots and Puru elephants \u2013 and 4 bonus technologies that can be used in future scenarios. Unleash the full might of your expanding empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/7f4f2996b5e9e5483f33ed610c6e7d81.poster.avif?t=1758231358\" aria-label=\"Animated GIF from Age of Empires II: Definitive Edition \u2013 Providence, featuring three rapid scenes. First, a lush green battlefield unfolds with rocky cliffs and a river flowing north to south. A green-trimmed army of elephant riders charges into defending forces near a stone-built village. The scene transitions to a large stone city under siege, where green-trimmed Infantry and Battering Rams have broken through the gates and push into nearby buildings. The final scene zooms in on a castle crumbling to the ground as a Battering Ram rolls onward toward its next target. The animation highlights shifting terrain, unit diversity, and the escalating momentum of ancient warfare.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/7f4f2996b5e9e5483f33ed610c6e7d81.webm?t=1758231358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/extras/7f4f2996b5e9e5483f33ed610c6e7d81.mp4?t=1758231358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Presentation &amp; Soundtrack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overhauled siege unit graphics heighten the immersion for which Chronicles is celebrated, while 13 new music tracks for both campaign and skirmish modes provide a thrilling soundtrack for your empire\u2019s rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793540?t=1758231358","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/a281f8d26230db2141706a786e75e3807f0f65d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758231358","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/ad1eea9803961ec7d4306565c7673a9fc888c613/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758231358","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793540/ad1eea9803961ec7d4306565c7673a9fc888c613/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758231358","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for the next chapter in the fan-favorite <i>Chronicles</i> saga by stepping into th